25\n19                                                   Time: 10:00 a.m.\n                                                     Courtroom: 4, 17th Floor\n20\n21\n                                                     Complaint Filed: September 23, 2024\n22                                                   Removal Filed: November 27, 2024\n                                                     Trial Date: TBD\n23\n24\n25\n26\n27\n28\n\n                                                                      CERT. OF SERVICE\n                                                                      3:24-CV-25-8548-VC\n                                             1\n\f             Case 3:24-cv-08548-VC            Document 35       Filed 01/02/25     Page 2 of 2\n\n\n\n\n 1          Before the Court is an administrative motion by Defendants Oura Health Oy and\n 2   Ouraring Inc. collectively \u201cDefendants\u201d) pursuant to Local Civil Rule 6-3 and for an order\n 3   extending Defendants\u2019 time to file Oppositions to Motion By Plaintiff Brees Company, Inc. to\n 4   Remand Case to San Francisco Superior Court and for an Award of Costs, Expenses, and Fees to\n 5\n     be Paid by Defendants Oura Ring, Inc. and Oura Health and Their Counsel, Peter McMahon and\n 6\n     McMahon Serepca LLP in the Amount of $47,239.17 (\u201cMotion to Remand\u201d).\n 7\n            Having considered the parties\u2019 submissions and arguments in support of and/or in\n 8\n     opposition to the motion, and for good cause shown:\n 9\n     IT IS HEREBY ORDERED that:\n10\n                   1.         Defendant\u2019s DEFENDANTS\u2019 MOTION TO EXTEND TIME FOR\n11\n     DEFENDANTS TO FILE OPPOSITION TO MOTION BY PLAINTIFF BREES COMPANY,\n12\n     INC. TO REMAND CASE TO SAN FRANCISCO SUPERIOR COURT AND FOR AN\n13\n     AWARD OF COSTS, EXPENSES is GRANTED;\n14\n                   2.         Defendants\u2019 Opposition to Plaintiff\u2019s Motion to Remand is to be filed on\n15\n     or by January 9, 2025.\n16\n     IT IS SO ORDERED.\n17\n18   DATED: ___________, 2025                       ____________________________________\n                                                             VINCE CHHABRIA\n19                                                         United States District Judge\n20\n21\n22\n23\n24\n25\n26\n27\n28\n\n                                                                                 CERT. OF SERVICE\n                                                                                 3:24-CV-25-8548-VC\n                                                       2\n\f", "ocr_status": 2, "date_upload": "2025-01-03T08:18:05.546519-08:00", "document_number": "35", "attachment_number": null, "pacer_doc_id": "035025241128", "is_available": true, "is_free_on_pacer": null, "is_sealed": null, "document_type": 1, "description": "Proposed Order", "acms_document_guid": ""}], "date_created": "2025-01-03T00:00:57.382010-08:00", "date_modified": "2025-01-03T00:00:57.393663-08:00", "date_filed": "2025-01-02", "time_filed": "23:34:54", "entry_number": 35, "recap_sequence_number": "2025-01-02.001", "pacer_sequence_number": 89, "description": "", "tags": []}, {"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/docket-entries/411867729/", "id": 411867729, "docket": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/dockets/69421939/", "recap_documents": [{"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/recap-documents/425063596/", "id": 425063596, "tags": [], "absolute_url": "/docket/69421939/33/brees-company-inc-v-oura-health-oy/", "date_created": "2024-12-23T10:03:37.162345-08:00", "date_modified": "2024-12-23T10:03:37.170491-08:00", "sha1": "", "page_count": null, "file_size": null, "filepath_local": null, "filepath_ia": "", "ia_upload_failure_count": null, "thumbnail": null, "thumbnail_status": 0, "plain_text": "", "ocr_status": null, "date_upload": null, "document_number": "33", "attachment_number": null, "pacer_doc_id": "035025218518", "is_available":